		separate mod and is not affiliated with or endorsed by vectorwing.
	</p>
</div>
<style>
	.fd-footer {
		margin-top: 2rem;
		padding-top: 1rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--fd-border);
		font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
	}
	:global(main footer.sl-flex:not(:has(a))) {
		display: none;
	}
</style>
